#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:1020
msgid "Sandbox mode"
msgstr "Modalità sandbox"

#: admin/template/settings/tax.php:1021
msgid ""
"Talks to the TaxJar sandbox with the sandbox token. Not live; turn off "
